		"Motorized controls",
		"Patch morphing",
		"Multitimbral operation",
		"USB MIDI",
		"DIN MIDI",
		"Sequencing"
	],
	"hardwareControls": [
		"Oscillators: Tune, Shape, Width, Level",
		"Filter: Cutoff, Resonance, Drive",
		"Envelope: Attack, Decay, Sustain, Release",
		"Morph And Effects: Morph, FX Level, FX Select",
		"Patch And Display: Display, Load, Save, Multi"
	],
	"notice": "Set each layer MIDI channel, note range and voice allocation in the Multi configuration. USB host sockets connect controllers; use the USB device socket to connect a computer. Motorized controls change with the active patch, layer and modulation mode. Consult the support page for firmware supplements. 12-note mode shares six analog filter/VCA voice circuits; it does not provide twelve independent analog voices.  Exact browser MIDI port aliases have not been verified; select this profile manually. DIN-connected instruments appear under the interface port name. Physical controls are unbound; this profile does not provide a complete MIDI implementation. Diagrams show selected controls at illustrative positions; consult the manufacturer references for the full panel.",
